# 1. Ignore all files in the repository
*

# 2. Re-include all directories (so Git can scan subfolders)
!*/

# 3. Re-include all files that contain a dot extension (e.g., .txt, .py, .js)
!*.*

# 4. (Optional) Re-include specific extensionless files you DO want to track
!Makefile
!Dockerfile
!LICENSE